{"id":"invisible","lemma":"invisible","pos":"adj","rank":2656,"glosses":["invisible"],"ipa":"/imbiˈsible/","forms":{"femininePlural":"invisibles"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-invisible.wav","examples":[{"text":"El aire es invisible.","en":"Air is invisible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636421","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"air"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Las cicatrices son casi invisibles.","en":"The scars are barely visible.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"scar, cicatrix","l":"cicatriz"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"almost"},null]},{"text":"Si fuera invisible no tendría que vestirme.","en":"If I were invisible I wouldn't have to dress myself.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734708","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"outside, out"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to dress","l":"vestir"}]},{"text":"Las bacterias son invisibles a simple vista.","en":"Bacteria are invisible to the naked eye.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1154785","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"bacterium","l":"bacteria"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,7,"to the naked eye"]]},{"text":"Contra la nieve, el conejo blanco era invisible.","en":"Against the snow, the white rabbit was invisible.","words":[{"g":"antidote"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"snow"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"rabbit, cony, coney"},{"g":"white"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]}]}